{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","极乐盛宴"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","The Main Course"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","被动地，法蒂玛释放技能对多名敌人造成伤害后会永久强化对应技能。主动释放时对指定范围内的敌人造成伤害并使自身恢复生命值。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Passive. When Voracia deals damage to multiple enemies with a skill, that skill is permanently enhanced.\nActive. Voracia deals damage to enemies in the target area and heals herself."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，法蒂玛释放一次技能若能命中不少于3名敌人或所有存活敌人，会进一步觉醒食欲，立即使对应技能获得“狂热”效果。\n主动释放时，自身处于霸体状态，选择一个地图格召唤半径为1格的餐盘，随后用丝线将周围2格范围内的敌人拉入餐盘范围并使其倒地4秒。随后法蒂玛品尝盘中美食，对每名敌人造成总计800% + 100% ATK伤害，并使自身恢复实际伤害量45% + 4%的生命值。本技能“狂热”后会在造成伤害时附带70点穿透。自动战斗时优先选择最密集的敌方区域释放。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Passive. When Voracia deals damage to at least 3 enemies or all surviving enemies with a skill, her appetite awakens, immediately granting Fervor to that skill.\nActive. Voracia remains unaffected. She summons a plate covering a 1-tile radius on a target tile. She uses her threads to pull enemies within 2 tiles onto the plate, knocking them down for 4s. Voracia then samples the \"food\" on the plate, dealing 800% + 100% ATK damage to each enemy and healing herself for 45% + 4% of the actual damage dealt. If enhanced by Fervor, this skill gains 70 Penetration when dealing damage.\nIn Auto Battle, this skill prioritizes the area with the most enemies."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":146,"end":153,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":174,"end":179,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":413,"end":420,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":473,"end":478,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":68,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":142,"end":157,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":185,"end":195,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":409,"end":424,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至850% + 100% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 850% + 100% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":41,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至900% + 100% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 900% + 100% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":41,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至950% + 100% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 950% + 100% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":41,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至1000% + 100% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 1000% + 100% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":35,"end":42,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","猩红剔骨"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Prime Cut"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","用餐刀切割敌人，对一定范围内的敌人造成多次伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Voracia slashes enemies within range several times with her dining knife."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","法蒂玛用餐刀切割敌方最密集的区域，对7格范围内的每名敌人造成总共450% + 50% ATK伤害。本技能“狂热”后会额外进行切割造成220% + 25% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Voracia slashes through the area with the most enemies using her dining knife, dealing 450% + 50% ATK damage to each enemy within 7 tiles. If enhanced by Fervor, she performs an extra slash that deals 220% + 25% ATK damage."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":70,"end":76,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":91,"end":97,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":205,"end":211,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":66,"end":80,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":87,"end":101,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":201,"end":215,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至460% + 50% ATK，额外切割伤害提高至230% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases basic slash damage to 460% + 50% ATK and the extra slash's damage to 230% + 25% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":33,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":83,"end":89,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":29,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":32,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":79,"end":93,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至470% + 50% ATK，额外切割伤害提高至240% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases basic slash damage to 470% + 50% ATK and the extra slash's damage to 240% + 25% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":33,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":83,"end":89,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":29,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":32,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":79,"end":93,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至480% + 50% ATK，额外切割伤害提高至250% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases basic slash damage to 480% + 50% ATK and the extra slash's damage to 250% + 25% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":33,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":83,"end":89,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":29,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":32,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":79,"end":93,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","烈焰酒烩"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Vino Inferno"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","用红酒和魔法炙烤敌人，持续对范围内的敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Voracia roasts enemies in an area with red wine and magic, dealing continuous damage."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","法蒂玛向敌方最密集区域泼洒半径1格范围的红酒，并用魔法炙烤敌人持续5秒，期间每0.5秒对其中敌人造成45% + 6% ATK伤害。本技能“狂热”后会在炙烤结束时额外点燃红酒爆发火焰，对范围内的敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Voracia splashes red wine over a 1-tile area, prioritizing the area with the most enemies. She then roasts enemies in the area with magic for 5s, dealing 45% + 6% ATK damage every 0.5s. If enhanced by Fervor, the wine ignites at the end of the roast, bursting into flames and dealing an extra 240% + 30% ATK damage to enemies within range."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":53,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":104,"end":110,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":157,"end":162,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":297,"end":303,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":50,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":100,"end":114,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":154,"end":166,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":293,"end":307,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至50% + 6% ATK，额外伤害提高至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases roast damage to 50% + 6% ATK and the extra flame damage to 260% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":73,"end":79,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":26,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":69,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至55% + 6% ATK，额外伤害提高至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases roast damage to 55% + 6% ATK and the extra flame damage to 280% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":73,"end":79,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":26,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":69,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至60% + 6% ATK，额外伤害提高至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases roast damage to 60% + 6% ATK and the extra flame damage to 300% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":73,"end":79,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":26,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":69,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力，觉醒食欲后额外提升攻击力。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases ATK during battle, with an extra increase once Voracia's appetite awakens."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，法蒂玛提高9%攻击力，觉醒食欲后额外提高6%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Voracia increases her ATK by 9% during battle. Once her appetite awakens, she increases her ATK further by 6%."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，法蒂玛提高12%攻击力，觉醒食欲后额外提高8%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Voracia increases her ATK by 12% during battle. Once her appetite awakens, she increases her ATK further by 8%."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，法蒂玛提高15%攻击力，觉醒食欲后额外提高10%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Voracia increases her ATK by 15% during battle. Once her appetite awakens, she increases her ATK further by 10%."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","终极品鉴"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Chef's Choice"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","所有技能获得强化后，吞噬一名敌人获得其部分属性，并使其永久失去能量。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Once all her skills are enhanced, Voracia devours an enemy to absorb some of their stats and causes them to permanently lose all their Energy."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","法蒂玛的所有技能都获得“狂热”效果后，张开血盆大口吞噬累计造成伤害最高的敌人，造成900% ATK伤害，吞噬并获得其35%的基础属性，每次吞噬获得的属性不超过自身对应初始属性的50%。若目标为非首领敌人，还会使其永久失去所有能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Once all her skills have gained Fervor, Voracia opens her jaws and devours the enemy with the highest cumulative damage dealt, dealing 900% ATK damage and gaining 35% of that enemy's basic stats. For each devour, the value gained per stat cannot exceed 50% of her corresponding initial stat value. If the target is not a boss, they also permanently lose all Energy."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":62,"end":66,"tooltip_key":"keyword:basicattr"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":135,"end":143,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":183,"end":194,"tooltip_key":"keyword:basicattr"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","吞噬并获得的基础属性提高至37.5%，每次吞噬获得的属性不超过自身对应初始属性的55%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the basic stats absorbed per devour to 37.5%, and raises the cap for each absorbed stat to 55% of the initial value of Voracia's corresponding stat."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":10,"tooltip_key":"keyword:basicattr"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":14,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"keyword:basicattr"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","释放本技能时额外选择另一名累计造成伤害最高的敌人吞噬。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","When casting this skill, Voracia devours an additional enemy with the next highest cumulative damage dealt."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","吞噬并获得的基础属性提高至40%，每次吞噬获得的属性不超过自身对应初始属性的60%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the basic stats absorbed per devour to 40%, and raises the cap for each absorbed stat to 60% of the initial value of Voracia's corresponding stat."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":10,"tooltip_key":"keyword:basicattr"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":14,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"keyword:basicattr"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“极乐盛宴”造成伤害时额外附带生命削减。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","The Main Course also inflicts max HP reduction when dealing damage."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“极乐盛宴”造成伤害时额外附带相当于伤害量35%的生命削减。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When The Main Course deals damage, it also inflicts max HP reduction equal to 35% of the damage dealt."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":52,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","蛛丝秘戒"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Silkweave Ring"]]}